			"Message": "refactor: Improve code formatting and readability across multiple files\n\nSigned-off-by: Nikola Hristov <Nikola@PlayForm.Cloud>",
			"SHA": "61e6b139e60ee817cbdd6ecd8b9ea60ce97b55ef"
